  "description": "<p>As a follow-on to <a href=\"https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3232\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3232</a>, the following wiki documentation pages must be updated:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Versioning\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Versioning</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Versioning\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Versioning</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>In addition to other documentation updates, the following note should be include:<br/>\n&gt; The memento API has second level granularity. If you attempt to create multiple mementos within the same second, then only the last memento created will be accessible.</p>",
